1*20*34%20mm.%20Edge%20enhancement%20is%20noted%20post-contrast%20administration%2C%20surrounded%20by%20a%20peripheral%20edema%20zone.%20Multiple%20punctate%20lesions%20showing%20iso-to-hypointensity%20on%20T1W%20and%20hyperintensity%20on%20T2W%2FFLAIR%20sequences%20are%20seen%20bilaterally%20in%20the%20frontal%20lobes%2C%20periventricular%20regions%2C%20and%20basal%20ganglia.%20The%20cerebral%20cisterns%20and%20ventricles%20are%20slightly%20enlarged.%20Sulcal%20widening%20and%20deepening%20are%20present%2C%20with%20no%20midline%20shift.%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200cm%3B%20text-align%3A%20justify%3B%26quot%3B%20class%3D%26quot%3BMsoNormal%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20face%3D%26quot%3BTimes%20New%20Roman%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bbackground-color%3A%20transparent%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bline-height%3A%20140%25%3B%20color%3A%20rgb\(241%2C%20156%2C%20153\)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%20style%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BReference%20standard%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200cm%3B%20text-align%3A%20justify%3B%26quot%3B%20class%3D%26quot%3BMsoNormal%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20face%3D%26quot%3BTimes%20New%20Roman%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%20color%3A%20rgb\(241%2C%20156%2C%20153\)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Btext-align%3A%20start%3B%20background-color%3A%20transparent%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B1.Right%20occipital%20lobe%20%2B%20brain%20abscess%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Btext-align%3A%20start%3B%20background-color%3A%20transparent%3B%26quot%3B%20class%3D%26quot%3BApple-converted-space%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan